#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/xdg-dbus-proxy.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>xdg-dbus-proxy</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
